{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Awaken in the Third, a mysterious world filled with dozens of unique enemies and environments. Using only a slingshot, can you fight your way to victory, when a single hit can kill you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SKILL BASED PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are no powerups or leveling systems. Progression is tied solely to your skill as a player. And in a world where most enemies die in a single hit, this means constantly adapting to new attack and movement patterns. From sandfish that leap out of the ground to snowballs that split apart when you hit them, each enemy offers a unique challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484610/extras/sandfish.gif?t=1752758296\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BATTLE SINGULARITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face enormous machines with ever shifting weak points and methods of attack. Each machine felled unlocks a new region to explore and new enemies to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484610/extras/queen.gif?t=1752758296\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE DIVERSE WORLDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From sprawling cityscapes to desolate wastelands, discover dozens of unique environments spread across 7 regions. And with new side quests, mechanics, and enemies in each region, Akashic Slingshot offers a huge amount of content just waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484610/extras/worlds.gif?t=1752758296\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPECT THE UNEXPECTED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more you play, the more the world will change. Where do the limits of this game truly lie?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484610/extras/eye.gif?t=1752758296\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3484610?t=1752758296","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484610/20ddd0adcb40b0133fcdee1b691697e23766d549/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752758296","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484610/58f6cc7c9aa2e5331cc036d6d376e0052348b33d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752758296","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484610/58f6cc7c9aa2e5331cc036d6d376e0052348b33d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752758296","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Awaken in the Third, a mysterious world filled with dozens of unique enemies and environments. Using only a slingshot, can you fight your way to victory, when a single hit can kill you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SKILL BASED PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are no powerups or leveling systems. Progression is tied solely to your skill as a player. And in a world where most enemies die in a single hit, this means constantly adapting to new attack and movement patterns. From sandfish that leap out of the ground 